    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRPSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-01-05T14:21:17+05:30\"\u003eJanuary 5, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e2:21 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/\"\u003eRajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released the\u003cstrong\u003e Tentative Exam Calendar\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the \u003cstrong\u003eRajasthan Various Post Examination 2025.\u003c/strong\u003e The exam will be conducted on \u003cstrong\u003e11 January 2026 To 27 December 2026,\u003c/strong\u003e and the last date to submit the application form was\u003cstrong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;2025\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eExam Date /\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eExam Calendar\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;using their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\"\u003eEnrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRPSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRPSC Various Post Examination 2026 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/rpsc-exam-calendar-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCalendar Available Date :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e26 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"\u003eExam Date : 11 January 2026 To 27 December 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cb\u003eRPSC\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;official website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"\u003eVisit Official Website\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eRPSC Various Post Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On RPSC Rules\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"\u003eVisit Official Website\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRPSC\u003c/strong\u003e provides age relaxation for the\u003cstrong\u003e Various Post \u003c/strong\u003eposition as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003eN/A\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eRPSC Various Post Recruitment 2026 : Vacancy Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 36.7196%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExam Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 63.2804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExam Conducted By\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 36.7196%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eRPSC Various Posts Tentative Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 63.2804%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eRajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC) organize exams regularly.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #800000;\"\u003eYou May Also Check :\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/niacl-apprentices-online-form-2025/\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNIACL Apprentices Recruitment 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download RPSC Exam Calendar 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"359\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eVisit the \u003cstrong data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"358\"\u003eofficial website of Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"458\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the homepage, go to the \u003cstrong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"449\"\u003e“Examination Schedule / Exam Calendar / Notifications”\u003c/strong\u003e section.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"524\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLook for the notification titled \u003cstrong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"523\"\u003eRPSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"573\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on the \u003cstrong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"559\"\u003eExam Calendar\u003c/strong\u003e notification.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"643\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eThe exam calendar will open in \u003cstrong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"623\"\u003ePDF format\u003c/strong\u003e or as a \u003cstrong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"642\"\u003enotice\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"763\"\u003e\u003cspan s